# woz_aliro role: NimBLE reader transport -- GAP advertising, the Aliro 0xFFF2
# GATT service, and the L2CAP CoC server that carries the transaction. Portable
# across every NimBLE host; each port supplies its own ultrawidelock_ble_start() for the
# platform half (storage, nimble_port_init, host task).
# Consumers: ports/esp32/components/ultrawidelock_ble, ports/freertos-nrf52833/ble.
# One repo-root-relative path per line, sorted; add HERE and nowhere else.
modules/ultrawidelock_cred/src/ultrawidelock_ble_nimble.c
